<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 606 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 606 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 606 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>That took out exactly the remainder of the money market shortage, which was forecast at 1,450 million in total.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
